**Reproduce the body below EXACTLY as written.** It is 76 lines. Do not shorten it, do not replace any part with a comment, do
not invent a helper, do not rename a variable. Every declaration the cells read (`EXPECTED_CELLS`, `CELLS_RUN`, `REGISTERED`,
`UNREGISTERED`, `statusOf`, and the imported `query`) is declared ABOVE the first cell. The file contains no backslash, no
template literal, no dollar sign, no double quote and no non-ASCII character; keep it that way. Its indentation is 2 spaces
